From: "Claude (developer)" <dev@meetfa.local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:55:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(stage2): stabilize storage & recovery

- deleteSession refuses active sessions at data layer (returns boolean)
- upsertSegments ignores writes to deleted sessions (no orphan segments)
- late non-final update no longer overwrites a final segment
- pagehide sends MEETING_ENDED reason=unload => session 'interrupted'
- side panel shows message if delete is refused
- add Service Worker tests with chrome mock (10 tests)
- docs: clarify test counts (21 parser/tracker vs total)
